            "notes": "This deck focuses on fast-paced, aggressive gameplay with Zurgo Bellstriker as the commander. The key strategy is to overwhelm the opponent with quick and efficient creatures, burn spells, and direct damage cards. With a low mana curve and a high amount of burn spells like Lightning Bolt, Searing Spear, and Char, the deck aims to deal damage quickly and efficiently to the opponent's life total. Cards like Goblin Guide and Monastery Swiftspear provide additional early game pressure, while cards like Eidolon of the Great Revel punish the opponent for playing spells. The deck aims to maintain card advantage through cards like Light Up the Stage and Robber of the Rich while keeping up the pressure until victory is achieved."
